From 5a9566bb65d27fbdfd65a2a9278e4736b233611c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: suvojeet-sengupta <suvojitsengupta21@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 06:29:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] PIHooks: Drop the Play Integrity spoofing

Keep the Google Photos, Pixel feature, ARCore and Netflix props, but stop spoofing a certified build to Play Services and the Play Store, blocking their key attestation, fetching certified props with AttestationService and letting GMS skip the task permission checks.

Change-Id: Ia5dc6918731a72c3c373a2a1d652015300a14302
---
